# Kafka Transaction Producer

This module is responsible for simulating real-time financial transactions using the PaySim dataset.

## Objective

The Python producer will read historical transactions and publish them continuously to an Apache Kafka topic.

## Data Flow

PaySim Dataset
      ↓
Python Producer
      ↓
Apache Kafka
      ↓
Spark Structured Streaming
      ↓
Fraud Detection Model
      ↓
Fraud Alerts

## Planned Responsibilities

- Read PaySim transaction data.
- Select transaction records for streaming.
- Convert transactions into messages.
- Publish messages to a Kafka topic.
- Simulate continuous transaction activity.

## Technology

- Python
- Apache Kafka
- PaySim Dataset
